  "result": "Perfect! I've successfully added voucher functionality to the invoicing system. Here's what was implemented:\n\n## Changes\n\n**src/errors.js** \u2013 Added new error code:\n- VOUCHER_EXISTS for duplicate vouchers on an invoice\n\n**src/invoices.js** \u2013 Enhanced invoice functionality:\n\n1. **Updated `invoiceTotals()`**:\n   - Now accepts invoices with vouchers\n   - Returns a `voucher` field (amount or 0)\n   - New calculation: `total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher`\n\n2. **Added `applyVoucher(invoice, { code, amount })`**:\n   - Applies a fixed-amount voucher to a draft invoice\n   - Returns `ok(newInvoice)` with `invoice.voucher = { code, amount }`\n   - Validation:\n     - **NOT_DRAFT**: Only drafts can have vouchers\n     - **VOUCHER_EXISTS**: Only one voucher per invoice\n     - **AMOUNT_INVALID**: Amount must be a positive integer (cents)\n\n**test/invoices.test.js** \u2013 Added 10 comprehensive tests:\n- Successful voucher application\n- Amount validation (non-integer, zero, negative)\n- Draft-only enforcement\n- Single voucher per invoice\n- Total calculations with vouchers\n- Immutability verification\n\n**Test Results**: All 174 tests pass (164 previous + 10 new)",
